'Self-service can make over-requesting easier if the catalog is unclear or eligibility is broad. Test approval, denial, timeout, expiration, extension and failed downstream provisioning. A completed approval page is not proof that the user can perform the intended task, and a removed assignment is not proof that every application session ended.'
