'A readiness dashboard can combine lifecycle task results, application installation, access assignments, passkey registration and BitLocker state. Notifications can route a failed app, missing recovery key or expiring TAP to the correct team. Never display the TAP or BitLocker recovery key in the public workshop; show status and redacted identifiers only.',
'Background encryption and app delivery can outlast the first sign-in. Test interrupted downloads, a consumed or expired TAP, failed passkey registration, device restart during encryption and recovery-key escrow. An app tile is not proof the application works, and an encryption policy assignment is not proof the disk is protected.'
