'A fully automated conversion is attractive at scale but dangerous when source data is ambiguous. Keep human review for conflicting records and high-impact entitlements. Test cancellation, a changed start date and partial application failure. Preserve an evidence trail showing why the records were matched and which permissions were retained, replaced or removed; do not infer continuity from matching display names.'
