'Reducing recovery friction must not undermine identity verification. Define a controlled process for changed email addresses, suspected compromise and repeated failures. Rehearse with a dedicated account and authorized operator; do not reset a working client account as a presentation trick. Successful recovery proves control of the account through that flow, not a new entitlement to additional vendor resources.'
