'Blocking on too many applications can lengthen or break enrollment; allowing too little to block can leave the employee unable to work. Test a real eligible device from a clean starting state, including slow networks and app installation failures. Configuration screenshots cannot substitute for out-of-box proof. Keep recovery instructions that do not depend on access to the laptop that is still being enrolled.'
